{
  "_comment": [
    "HUB PAGE GRAPH — one per pillar hub at /encyclopedia/{hub}/, plus the root",
    "index at /encyclopedia/ (which uses the same shape with hub-level breadcrumbs",
    "trimmed to two items and ItemList enumerating the eight hubs).",
    "",
    "WHAT FILLS THE PLACEHOLDERS — all from data/taxonomy.json and the hub's own",
    "content/{hub}/index.md frontmatter.",
    "",
    "  {{HUB_URL}}            absolute hub URL, e.g. https://opengrants.io/encyclopedia/budgets/",
    "  {{HUB_TITLE}}          taxonomy `hubs[].title` — equals the visible H1",
    "  {{HUB_DESCRIPTION}}    frontmatter `metaDescription` from content/{hub}/index.md",
    "  {{DATE_PUBLISHED}} {{DATE_MODIFIED}}   ISO 8601 with timezone; must match the",
    "                         visible Published / Last reviewed lines exactly",
    "  {{CHILD_N_TITLE}} {{CHILD_N_URL}}      taxonomy `hubs[].children[]`, IN TAXONOMY",
    "                         ORDER. Emit one ListItem per child, positions 1..n,",
    "                         1-indexed and contiguous. The two below are shape examples;",
    "                         hubs carry 6 to 11 children.",
    "  {{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_3}}    third sameAs URL, supplied by a human. Do not invent one.",
    "  {{CITATION_NAME_N}} {{CITATION_URL_N}}  hub pages carry 8-12 external citations too;",
    "                         populate from data/manifest.json `externalSources`.",
    "",
    "RULES",
    "  1. ItemList must enumerate EVERY child of the hub, in taxonomy order, and each",
    "     child must also be linked in the visible hub prose. Schema that lists a child",
    "     the page does not visibly link is a mismatch with visible text.",
    "  2. A hub page is a real article, not a link directory. It emits Article/",
    "     TechArticle like any other page; the ItemList is additional, not a substitute.",
    "  3. No Google rich result exists for a non-carousel ItemList. Emit it for",
    "     structural clarity, expecting no rich-result benefit.",
    "  4. Organization and the author Person are @id references only.",
    "  5. Breadcrumbs represent the reader's path: Home > Encyclopedia > Hub."
  ],
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#article",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#webpage" },
      "mainEntityOfPage": { "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#webpage" },
      "headline": "{{HUB_TITLE}}",
      "name": "{{HUB_TITLE}}",
      "description": "{{HUB_DESCRIPTION}}",
      "inLanguage": "en-US",
      "isAccessibleForFree": true,
      "datePublished": "{{DATE_PUBLISHED}}",
      "dateModified": "{{DATE_MODIFIED}}",
      "author": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/authors/sedale-turbovsky/#person" },
      "reviewedBy": { "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#reviewer" },
      "publisher": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#organization" },
      "citation": [
        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "name": "{{CITATION_NAME_1}}",
          "url": "{{CITATION_URL_1}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "CollectionPage",
      "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#webpage",
      "url": "{{HUB_URL}}",
      "name": "{{HUB_TITLE}}",
      "description": "{{HUB_DESCRIPTION}}",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#website" },
      "breadcrumb": { "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#breadcrumb" },
      "mainEntity": { "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#itemlist" },
      "datePublished": "{{DATE_PUBLISHED}}",
      "dateModified": "{{DATE_MODIFIED}}",
      "inLanguage": "en-US"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#itemlist",
      "name": "{{HUB_TITLE}}",
      "description": "{{HUB_DESCRIPTION}}",
      "itemListOrder": "https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending",
      "numberOfItems": "{{CHILD_COUNT}}",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "{{CHILD_1_TITLE}}",
          "url": "{{CHILD_1_URL}}"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "{{CHILD_2_TITLE}}",
          "url": "{{CHILD_2_URL}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#breadcrumb",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Home",
          "item": "https://opengrants.io/"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "Encyclopedia",
          "item": "https://opengrants.io/encyclopedia/"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 3,
          "name": "{{HUB_TITLE}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Person",
      "@id": "https://opengrants.io/authors/sedale-turbovsky/#person",
      "name": "{{AUTHOR_NAME}}",
      "url": "https://opengrants.io{{AUTHOR_PROFILE_URL}}",
      "jobTitle": "{{AUTHOR_CREDENTIALS}}",
      "worksFor": { "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#organization" },
      "sameAs": [
        "{{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_1}}",
        "{{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_2}}",
        "{{AUTHOR_SAMEAS_3}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Person",
      "@id": "{{HUB_URL}}#reviewer",
      "name": "{{REVIEWER_NAME}}",
      "description": "{{REVIEWER_CREDENTIALS}}"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "@id": "https://opengrants.io/#organization"
    }
  ]
}
